  "details": "With the DMCA of Movie & Chill along with LS Media, it’s significantly more difficult to be able to watch shows/movies with friends on VRChat. Please add an official way to watch paid content like this!\n\nFor me and may others that frequently play VRChat, we greatly enjoy watching movies in VR. I personally would just switch to Bigscreen for movies, but basically none of my friends want to go through the hassle of learning another app just to watch something in VR. For example, Bigscreen allows you to rent movies, and others are able to join.  \n\nAt the least, I think something could be worked out to allow us to continue watching shows/movies without piracy.",
